                        ],
                        "form": "floconneuse"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "fe0c8f9e-5929-44fb-836b-1a8cf51e4443",
                        "entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "floconneuses"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                        "entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui a la forme de flocons."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a115121-7ad0-49fc-9212-cb724f8c04bd",
                                "sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                                "text": "Il saisit Héloïse, l'enlève entre ses bras comme une balle de fougère, une sachée de linaigrettes floconneuses, et la transporte doucement, parmi les couvertures qu'il rabat sur elle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7c05a6a-ad42-403c-9c55-ff42c6b6e836",
                                "sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                                "text": "C'était une soirée délicieuse : dans le firmament d'une douceur et d'une pureté inénarrables, la lune gravitait solitaire, chassant devant elle une multitude de petits nuages floconneux."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f604940-e18f-416f-8856-25f5586a8ab0",
                        "source_entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "source_sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                        "target_lang_word": "flockig",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d2ba12aa-bc1f-45d2-8466-873f103031fb",
                        "source_entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "source_sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                        "target_lang_word": "flaky",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "flaky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "888270ac-5ab5-35e0-a32f-b191857e150d",
                                        "entry_id": "d208aeab-6587-305f-a935-55e0741e7716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Consisting of flakes or of small, loose masses; lying, or cleaving off, in flakes or layers; flakelike."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd0a8abf-8bc5-370f-b0f9-cca1aeb0ac56",
                                        "entry_id": "d208aeab-6587-305f-a935-55e0741e7716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unreliable; likely to make plans with others but then abandon those plans."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f98fc647-2fb2-4ab5-a987-736d6b526e42",
                                                "sense_id": "fd0a8abf-8bc5-370f-b0f9-cca1aeb0ac56",
                                                "text": "I have noticed that when hustlers upgrade themselves to models (as distinguished from models who have never hustled) they tend to continue being flaky about appointments. On my last trip to San Juan, Puerto Rico, I was stood up twice."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1cf4a3b-5629-3559-8ba3-09131267919c",
                                        "entry_id": "d208aeab-6587-305f-a935-55e0741e7716",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Unreliable; working only on an intermittent basis; likely due to malfunction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34f8807b-572e-4072-b99c-d01c8075c4b7",
                                                "sense_id": "e1cf4a3b-5629-3559-8ba3-09131267919c",
                                                "text": "I cannot enjoy the online game because of my flaky Internet connection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d99cb55-a64d-46cf-82b1-b45aea06381f",
                                                "sense_id": "e1cf4a3b-5629-3559-8ba3-09131267919c",
                                                "text": "Toeava went over unopposed to stretch his side's lead but Japan got on the scoreboard on 56 minutes, wing Hirotoki Onozawa intercepting an attempted offload from Slade, who had a rather flaky game, and running in from the All Blacks' 10m line."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6fa800bd-c198-4ef6-b2b3-b88ab9bf96d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "source_sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                        "target_lang_word": "fluffy",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "fluffy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7af94137-7b47-3ebb-aa7d-4155be47275e",
                                        "entry_id": "19e5c6b5-8d35-3d06-a52e-df95c8c36605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Covered with fluff."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57d86e9e-5f71-49be-b75a-7a23cc9eef8f",
                                                "sense_id": "7af94137-7b47-3ebb-aa7d-4155be47275e",
                                                "text": "Fluffy bunny rabbits are really nice to stroke."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "643d8ae8-f6ec-3602-a4cb-f93e70ebf502",
                                        "entry_id": "19e5c6b5-8d35-3d06-a52e-df95c8c36605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Light; soft; airy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "07d8a14a-e8f3-448c-958d-d8086723b3ec",
                                                "sense_id": "643d8ae8-f6ec-3602-a4cb-f93e70ebf502",
                                                "text": "I like my scrambled eggs to be light and fluffy in texture."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50898f9c-3265-3ded-8688-77045403f0b1",
                                        "entry_id": "19e5c6b5-8d35-3d06-a52e-df95c8c36605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Warm and comforting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b845fd1b-c84f-4c5d-af68-aa6756441461",
                                                "sense_id": "50898f9c-3265-3ded-8688-77045403f0b1",
                                                "text": "Being in love with my boyfriend gives me a fluffy feeling inside."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db2c50fc-5565-3a8f-a40c-67153632f6dd",
                                        "entry_id": "19e5c6b5-8d35-3d06-a52e-df95c8c36605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not clearly defined or explained; fuzzy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4ca9da4-48f8-4157-99e2-bcea087fef8d",
                                                "sense_id": "db2c50fc-5565-3a8f-a40c-67153632f6dd",
                                                "text": "Someone sold you the fluffy idea that brains triumphs^([sic]) over strength when you were picked last for the sports team."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4ff88f8-4bdc-3904-b9a3-7664505bf8a7",
                                        "entry_id": "19e5c6b5-8d35-3d06-a52e-df95c8c36605",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lightweight; superficial; lacking depth or seriousness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58aa0851-9af3-48cc-9090-bc6a309bd396",
                                                "sense_id": "d4ff88f8-4bdc-3904-b9a3-7664505bf8a7",
                                                "text": "And she is represented reading with great concentration, and not some fluffy novel but the rather politically oriented and literary Le Figaro, its title prominent if upside down in the foreground."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b0f16e7-efca-4694-8cb5-864ba707e71d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4ff88f8-4bdc-3904-b9a3-7664505bf8a7",
                                                "text": "There was, I think, always a fluffy element to the neo-Pagan movement, but since the Internet explosion of the mid-to-late 1990s, it's got much, much worse. Most of it can be blamed on commercial drivers, as the publishers who produced neo-Pagan material (and the authors who work for them) realised that there was a vast market for teen-witch kits, bogus grimoires, etc, and set out to exploit it […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "fluffy",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24d73c60-02da-3b98-b413-1a806dbcd70c",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa86d57-3bc0-3493-bdde-16c2fad3cfc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone or something that has a fluffy texture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b35876cb-751c-4a87-baaf-822235202073",
                                                "sense_id": "24d73c60-02da-3b98-b413-1a806dbcd70c",
                                                "text": "Children can pamper the fluffies in the pets' corner […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5559bf49-b055-3f59-bf55-d28b90304bc4",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa86d57-3bc0-3493-bdde-16c2fad3cfc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who is superficial, who lacks depth or seriousness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f27a0ab-6a02-47f2-90b9-6d23b84d3fdb",
                                                "sense_id": "5559bf49-b055-3f59-bf55-d28b90304bc4",
                                                "text": "The world is overrun with fluffies. There was, I think, always a fluffy element to the neo-Pagan movement, but since the Internet explosion of the mid-to-late 1990s, it's got much, much worse. Most of it can be blamed on commercial drivers, as the publishers who produced neo-Pagan material (and the authors who work for them) realised that there was a vast market for teen-witch kits, bogus grimoires, etc, and set out to exploit it […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "984ee8ab-b545-3619-b776-1efa978bff89",
                                        "entry_id": "cfa86d57-3bc0-3493-bdde-16c2fad3cfc9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A babycino (frothy milk drink)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "New-Zealand"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "29ce97c7-cc2d-4eaa-9f3d-2bd3244e6288",
                        "source_entry_id": "5250a0e7-0080-3ba9-96e4-cdf2f647b938",
                        "source_sense_id": "a69c89bb-28c4-379f-a80d-3874e4a3fc80",
                        "target_lang_word": "хлопчатый",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "хлопчатый",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1897867d-06c7-31e9-9628-b79d7b1f4fc8",
                                        "entry_id": "d1422483-32ac-387d-9a28-4ac05964d1fc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "изготовленный из хло́пка"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ba525fc-86dd-4b59-87ae-0241588e43a6",
                                                "sense_id": "1897867d-06c7-31e9-9628-b79d7b1f4fc8",
                                                "text": "В руках у него было блюдечко и белый кусок хлопчатой ваты."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a25753f-5c73-482a-aa00-41eccf832e7b",
                                                "sense_id": "1897867d-06c7-31e9-9628-b79d7b1f4fc8",
                                                "text": "Она была одета в белую хлопчатую блузку, легкую коричневую кофточку и черную кожаную юбку, открывавшую стройные ноги чуть выше колен."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "хлопчатый",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9f5adf3a-6e29-344b-a520-8206db2d5cb1",
                                        "entry_id": "55d20433-dc9a-3631-843e-9f69af411f80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "состоящий из хлопьев"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "741e974c-1465-4e69-9f71-c87399aa419d",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5adf3a-6e29-344b-a520-8206db2d5cb1",
                                                "text": "При осторожном подкислении разведенной уксусной кислотой нашатырного раствора глобулина в жидкости образуется муть, скоро оседающая на дно в виде белого хлопчатого осадка."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4571fb56-a439-4851-88d7-893518fdc11a",
                                                "sense_id": "9f5adf3a-6e29-344b-a520-8206db2d5cb1",
                                                "text": "Повалила хлопчатая снежная масса на мех его шубы; из хлопьев блеснул на меня бриллиантовым взглядом: из длинных и черных ресниц; побежал в «Скорпион» ― рука в руку; а голову ― набок; хлопчатая масса его завалила."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4792925d-df03-3b18-b0bf-f06461646751",
                                        "entry_id": "55d20433-dc9a-3631-843e-9f69af411f80",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "перен. напоминающий хлопья"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1465ad1-b8a8-4cad-aaae-343c429ecbd4",
                                                "sense_id": "4792925d-df03-3b18-b0bf-f06461646751",
                                                "text": "На небе в теплом мглисто-желтом свете стояла полная луна с легкими хлопчатыми облаками."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e25b1503-f33d-4495-821b-235b5682fc03",
                                                "sense_id": "4792925d-df03-3b18-b0bf-f06461646751",
                                                "text": "Первая шрапнель покрыла ряды неубранной пшеницы, и долго на синем фоне таял раздираемый ветром белый хлопчатый комочек дыма."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
